d your business you want a happy  life it's important to find the things  that time flies for with you it's the  thing that you wake up and you start  doing and then you look down and it's  already 6:00 at night where did the time  go  things where you forget to go to the  bathroom you forget to eat for me it's  helping entrepreneurs this has been an  insane busy day for me I've been filming  videos all day long this is one of my  last ones to record we've had a lot of  fans for the channel stop by and say hi  and shake hands and take selfies and  tweet out pictures it's been really  amazing and it fuels me you know when I  forget to eat  I haven't had my lunch you know I've  only had coffee in a bar so far you know  I forget to go to the bathroom and I'm  probably gonna go home and crash and go  crazy but the point is I love doing this  kind of work and so if you can  understand where you get lost in if you  understand where you can wake up and  start working on something and all of a  sudden hours have passed by and you  don't know where the time went  that's a good indication that you really  like this thing and maybe that's a way  to turn that into a bigger passion  purpose for you  [Music]  weena before find out what energizes you  going on a mission of finding a life's  purpose and vision is a powerful one but  it needs to come from a place of energy  and excitement so before you even worry  about finding your life's purpose and  vision make a list of things that  excites you and energizes you and don't  judge at all you know it could be  something I was like I love listening to  children's laughter to going on a long  walk on a beach - fighting social  injustice  whatever it is make a list of that and  the second thing you want to do is  engage in it so for me I wasn't born  knowing what my life's purpose and  vision is it took a lot of me trying  things that energized me to get there  two things that brings me a lot of  excitement and energy is one being a  